        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> I am open to try to expose as minimal information as possible by custom events, but other than that this is not planned as a part of 'mini.pick'.\r\n\r\nSeems fair. A PR exposing some of the private interfaces from mini.pick that would allow implementing this in a personal config would be considered?",
