            "body": "I probably overstated the \"intensive\" part. With my own timer-based preview visible alongside the picker nvim would idle at ~ 3% cpu use while showing the picker without preview idled at ~ 0.7%. 3% wasn't much, but a 4x increase non the less :sweat_smile:.",
